---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Steam Press Machines | Industrial Steam Pressing | Gartech Global" description="Professional steam press machines for commercial laundries, dry cleaners, and hotels. Industrial-grade steam pressing and garment finishing equipment from Gartech Global.">

  <!-- DARK HERO -->
  <section class="bg-zinc-950 text-white py-14 md:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-zinc-800 industrial-grid-dark">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400 mb-6">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">HOME</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-purple-400">STEAM PRESS MACHINES</span>
      </div>
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Garment Finishing &bull; Pneumatic &amp; Manual Series
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight mb-4">Steam Press Machines</h1>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-base md:text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Industrial-grade pneumatic steam pressing systems engineered for crisp finishes, zero garment shine, and rapid operator turnaround in commercial laundries and star hotels.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/steam-press-machines/model-alpha" class="px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-zinc-950 bg-white rounded-full hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-all">Explore Model Alpha</a>
        <a href="/contact?category=steam-press" class="px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-white/10 border border-white/15 rounded-full hover:bg-white/15 transition-all">Request Price Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTENT -->
  <section class="w-full py-16 bg-[#EFF1F5] industrial-grid border-b border-neutral-300">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border-t-4 border-t-purple-600 border-x border-b border-neutral-200 p-8 shadow-md">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-bold bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border border-purple-200">FLAGSHIP MODEL</span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-zinc-950 mt-4 mb-2">Steam Press Model Alpha</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Pneumatic utility press with precision pressure regulator, heated vacuum lower buck, and dual-hand safety actuation. Delivers up to 120 garments/hr.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-700 space-y-1 mb-6">
            <p>&bull; Pressing Surface: Cast Aluminum + Teflon Shoe</p>
            <p>&bull; Vacuum Suction: 0.55 kW High-Flow Motor</p>
            <p>&bull; Indicative Rate: ₹ 1,75,000*</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-3">
            <a href="/steam-press-machines/model-alpha" class="flex-1 py-2.5 text-center rounded-xl bg-zinc-950 text-white text-xs font-bold hover:bg-purple-600 transition-colors">Full Specifications</a>
            <a href="/contact?model=Model-Alpha" class="flex-1 py-2.5 text-center rounded-xl border border-neutral-300 text-zinc-950 text-xs font-bold hover:bg-neutral-50 transition-colors">Get Quote</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border-t-4 border-t-zinc-800 border-x border-b border-neutral-200 p-8 shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-bold bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-800 border border-neutral-300">OPERATIONAL IMPACT</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-zinc-950 mt-4 mb-3">Why Industrial Steam Pressing?</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Manual hand-ironing slows down commercial output and creates inconsistent creases. Pneumatic steam presses standardize finishing speed and fabric protection.
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-800">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-600"></span> 3x faster than manual electric hand irons</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-600"></span> Built-in vacuum cools and sets creases instantly</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-600"></span> Zero scorching on delicate silk, wool, and uniforms</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-600"></span> Ergonomic foot-pedal &amp; pneumatic assist reduces fatigue</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
